.TH CHTTPSVR_CONSTRUCT_SCOPED 3 "2026-07-10" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Macros"
.SH NAME
chttpsvr_construct_scoped \- declare, initialise, and auto-destroy a chttpsvr handle
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <chttpserver.h>

chttpsvr_construct_scoped(name, cl);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
Combines chttpsvr_declare_scoped and a create_chttpsvr(cl) call.
Declares name with a GCC cleanup attribute so that __chttpsvr_destroy
is called automatically when name leaves scope.  Calls fatal_err() and
does not return on failure.
.fi
.SH PARAMETERS
.nf
name     Identifier for the new handle variable.
cl       Parent logger to derive this server's logger from, or NULL
         to use an internal stderr/FATAL-only logger.  See
         create_chttpsvr_mp for details.
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR chttpsvr_construct (3),
.BR chttpsvr_declare_scoped (3),
.BR __chttpsvr_destroy (3)
